<title>USA: Group has 5.1 percent stake in Hollinger.</title>
<headline>Group has 5.1 percent stake in Hollinger.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1996-11-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>A group of two Forth Worth, Texas, limited partnerships said Monday it has acquired the equivalent of 3,035,891 common shares of Hollinger Inc., or 5.1 percent of the total outsanding.</p>
<p>In a filing with the Securities and Exchange Commission, the group, HBK Investments L.P. and HBK Main Street Investments L.P., said it acquired the stake as an investment for $37,788,270 in the form of the company's 13 percent convertible debentures due Oct. 5, 2013.</p>
</text>
